# rn_ab_ver5_45day_20260820 (2026-08-21 A/B 본실험)
# 원본 대용량 산출물은 로컬 보관한다. LLM 응답은 재현 불가이므로 삭제 금지.
# 커밋 대상은 분석에 필요한 요약·검증·서명 산출물로 한정한다.
outputs/logs/rn_ab_ver5_45day_20260820/*/.runtime/*.db
outputs/logs/rn_ab_ver5_45day_20260820/*/.runtime/response_journal.sqlite*
outputs/logs/rn_ab_ver5_45day_20260820/*/agent_turns.jsonl
outputs/logs/rn_ab_ver5_45day_20260820/*/agent_turns.csv
outputs/logs/rn_ab_ver5_45day_20260820/*/openrouter_calls.jsonl
outputs/logs/rn_ab_ver5_45day_20260820/*/community_events.jsonl
outputs/logs/rn_ab_ver5_45day_20260820/*/community_interactions.csv
outputs/logs/rn_ab_ver5_45day_20260820/*/community_logs.csv
outputs/logs/rn_ab_ver5_45day_20260820/*/community_selection_inputs.*
outputs/logs/rn_ab_ver5_45day_20260820/*/llm_validation_errors.jsonl
